{
  "$Comment": "Find a site near the quest's player and light the beam, as Goblin_Breach_Prelude_Stage1_Place does. The location condition keeps searching until a spot passes both spawner masks; the gameplay config's ExclusionRadius can hold it back while another event has a site nearby.",
